Package: nxd-xfce
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Manuel Jesús Romero Mateos <manu4.2012@gmail.com>
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Depends: nxd-common (= @VERSION@), x11-xserver-utils, xinput, x11-common
Recommends: xfce4-panel, xfce4-genmon-plugin, xfce4-pulseaudio-plugin, xfce4-power-manager-plugins, adwaita-icon-theme, thunar, xfce4-terminal
Homepage: https://github.com/manu-romero-411/nx-debian
Description: Debian on the Nintendo Switch: the XFCE desktop
 The system files of the nx-debian XFCE image: switch-rotate (turns the
 screen and the touchscreen together, and remembers it), switch-sensors (the
 SoC temperature and the fan for the panel), and the defaults of the desktop
 (theme, panels, default applications), which come before the XFCE packages'
 ones in the XFCE session and are overridden by the user's.
